  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for complete educational trajectories and their climate resilience</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de trayectorias educativas completas y su resiliencia al cambio climtico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es consolidar trayectorias educativas completas y su resiliencia al cambio climtico. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) Incrementar la oferta educativa con resiliencia al CC y nfasis en los niveles de parvularia y secundaria; (ii) incrementar los servicios de proteccin de trayectorias incluyendo poblacin migrante; (iii) fortalecer los servicios educativos para la inclusin de las PcD; y (iv) fortalecer las capacidades de gestin educativa, incluyendo la identificacin, diseo y ejecucin de proyectos que integren medidas de resiliencia frente al CC, y capacidades de monitoreo y reporte de impacto, contribuyendo a las condiciones asociadas al acceso a mercados de capital temtico verde.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Program is to consolidate complete educational trajectories and their climate change resilience. The specific objectives are: (i) to increase the provision of education with climate-resilient, and emphasis on early childhood and secondary education levels; (ii) to expand services for the protection of educational trajectories, including for migrant populations; (iii) to strengthen educational services for the inclusion of persons with disabilities (PwD); and (iv) to enhance educational management capacities, including the identification, design, and implementation of projects that integrate climate resilience measures, as well as monitoring and impact reporting capabilities, contributing to the conditions necessary for accessing green thematic capital markets.</narrative>
  </description>
